  "description": "The content-extraction package of the X-Ray family of .NET libraries: a pure-managed engine, ported natively to C# from the Rust `xberg` engine. The API lives under the `XRay.Content` namespace. Extracts text, metadata, tables and structured content from Office documents, PDF, HTML, email, archives and more. Extraction itself is pure managed; the optional OCR pass is off by default and brings native dependencies (SkiaSharp, PDFium) when enabled.",
